# System-X11 and libx11-compat XEphem startup differential capture.
# The Motif control window must come up against both stacks, render real
# content, and stay alive. The shared common-visible assertion (non-empty +
# not-all-black) catches a "window mapped but blank" regression without a
# calibrated per-app baseline; the cross-stack pixel diff is done afterward by
# scripts/compare-motif-reference.py.
delay 2000
wait-window "xephem" 20000
wait-converge 200 2 50 200 20000
screenshot startup
assert-image startup common-visible.json
assert-exit running
